			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839100">
									

<p>Sorry for the late reply!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Reply</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>For the sake of me not confusing myself, I'll name the Shadow &quot;Tom&quot; for this.<br />
When Tom manifested into our world, I was thinking that Clarence was created. Not out of Tom's decision, but out of Tom being here. Essentially, we are like shadows to Tom. Where he comes from, we are Shadows in his eyes. Vice versa.<br />
This idea initially clashed with my idea of letting him separate from Clarence, but I wanted really wanted to include it because I liked the concept of the ability.<br />
I was hoping of making where he came from a separate article in itself at a later date.</p>
<p>As for laying it out in the draft, I'm unsure. I was considering to hint to the fact that Tom is from someplace else. If you have input or suggestions, I would greatly appreciate them.<br /></p>
</div>
